# [xihanzu-NR]
# Scratch worklogs, never part of the project.
.worksprint.md
.worksprint2.md

# Dependencies. NOTE: without this, `git add -A` stages every dependency in the
# repository — there are example projects and a plugin each with their own
# node_modules, so a careless `add -A` offers ~28,000 files and 3.5M lines. It was
# missing before and this file is the fix.
node_modules/

# Build output.
dist/
compiler-rs/target/
target/

# Generated type declarations. These are produced by `hydra types` from the
# source; committing them means they can disagree with the component they
# describe, which is the one thing the generator exists to prevent.
*.hyx.d.ts
*.hsx.d.ts
*.hys.d.ts

# Editor and OS noise.
.DS_Store
*.swp
.vscode-test/
